    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it doesn't feel like a \"transition\"... it feels like a funeral. i'm just waiting for the rest of me to catch up to the part of me that already died. like, why do i have to keep doing this? the charade of being a person with a future when i can't even recognize the person in the mirror? it feels so useless.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
